      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I think I follow the interfacial bonding part. So basically the texture of the rebar helps it grip the concrete. Are there specific ways engineers design that \"lattice\" or \"grip\" to make sure the steel doesn't just slip out from inside the concrete under heavy load? Is it just about the surface area or something else?",
